{"3495110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Killer Chat! Christmas", "steam_appid": 3495110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4040360, 4040370], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: this is a standalone game. You do not need to download Killer Chat! to play, but we do recommend playing through Killer Chat!  first (it's free!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME BACK TO HELL, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a year has passed since asking too many murder-related questions online (for your <i>book</i>) got you invited to a serial killer chatroom. Of course, you did what<i> any</i> <span class=\"bb_strike\">in</span>sane person would do and<span class=\"bb_strike\"> called the police</span> pretended to be a serial killer. For, uh… <span class=\"bb_strike\">hot singles in your server</span> research purposes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, you got your <span class=\"bb_strike\">bad</span> happy ending. You’re now a bestselling writer, desperately in love, and have come to think of the server as family - it's like a dream come true. Sure, most of them still think you are a serial killer, your boss needs you to write another hit ASAP and your one true love is <span class=\"bb_strike\">definitely</span> <i>technically </i>a murderer, but look on the bright side - it’s Christmas! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/4afc5f89b6e139b8b9040cbe3a10304a.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/4afc5f89b6e139b8b9040cbe3a10304a.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this festive addition to the dark satire romance chatsim Killer Chat! series, journey through the server’s past, present &amp; future to learn more about our serials and find the true meaning of Christmas. What's the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a (fully customisable!) character as you… </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DATE SERIAL KILLERS! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whisper sweet nothings to your murderous beau and learn more about their <span class=\"bb_strike\">insecurities</span> lives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAT IN THE SLAUGHTERHOUSE :) </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The server's hosting a secret Santa blitz! Unlock <strong>16 unique gift options</strong> to impress (or distress) your loved one, and help the other serials decide what to get each other! And no Christmas would be complete without a delicious server meal on the 26th of December. It's true: Vince has made Christmas dinners a yearly thing now. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/727708a1fcb0c47e755d5efa258f1c15.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/727708a1fcb0c47e755d5efa258f1c15.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET INSPIRATION FOR YOUR SHORT STORY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending time in the server helped write a hit before, maybe it’ll help you again? Ugh. Why is writing so <i>hard?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable MC -</strong> now with festive wear! (Name, username, personality, gender, face, body, clothing, accessories, what kind of pseudo serial killer you are...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/183df89a2d6b3ac070a93cf30fb3a714.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/183df89a2d6b3ac070a93cf30fb3a714.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your own status, biography, and messages in chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=520 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <span class=\"bb_strike\">serial killers</span> love interests <strong>across all genders </strong>(male, female, non-binary)... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of approx. <strong>2-3 hours </strong>per route,<strong> 8-10 hours </strong>for all routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich, choice-based branching towards<strong> 6 unique endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the server's serial killers, earn the gang's <span class=\"bb_strike\">dis</span>approval, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system with <strong>30+ unique achievements</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An assortment of new art, including two illustrated CG's! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-made OST and sound effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death, murder, swearing, references to abuse, and serial killers... but you knew that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET YOUR LOVE INTERESTS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/f7ab8e78510d23ec49ff5721aa9e15b2.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/f7ab8e78510d23ec49ff5721aa9e15b2.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/595c625aeab6cb2b23c6272b29aa14de.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/595c625aeab6cb2b23c6272b29aa14de.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/7e5f3d4ed542fd93e2b90450414908a6.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/7e5f3d4ed542fd93e2b90450414908a6.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/dffb2382dd0dd2e6812358b1e09d0eaf.avif?t=1766692948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras_big/dffb2382dd0dd2e6812358b1e09d0eaf.avif?t=1766692948 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST OF THE GANG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend some more time getting to know the server’s other <span class=\"bb_strike\">murderers</span> loved-up couples. Help French arsonist Felicie and her unlucky surfer beau Luca decide what to get each other for Secret Santa, and see a softer side of Sunset Slasher Vince now his relationship with Ai Hua has gone public!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO HAVE A MERRY F'ING CHRISTMAS, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And may all your dreams come true...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: this is a standalone game. You do not need to download Killer Chat! to play, but we do recommend playing through Killer Chat!  first (it's free!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME BACK TO HELL, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a year has passed since asking too many murder-related questions online (for your <i>book</i>) got you invited to a serial killer chatroom. Of course, you did what<i> any</i> <span class=\"bb_strike\">in</span>sane person would do and<span class=\"bb_strike\"> called the police</span> pretended to be a serial killer. For, uh… <span class=\"bb_strike\">hot singles in your server</span> research purposes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, you got your <span class=\"bb_strike\">bad</span> happy ending. You’re now a bestselling writer, desperately in love, and have come to think of the server as family - it's like a dream come true. Sure, most of them still think you are a serial killer, your boss needs you to write another hit ASAP and your one true love is <span class=\"bb_strike\">definitely</span> <i>technically </i>a murderer, but look on the bright side - it’s Christmas! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_